Note on origins: this project implements the method described in the free
prompt packs "Build Jarvis Fully Offline" and "Give Your Jarvis X-Ray Vision"
by Zubair Trabzada (AI Workshop). The packs and their text remain the property
of their author; this code is an independent MIT implementation of the build
they describe.
